<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Cannabis Education Guide - UNLV Department of Pediatrics</title>
    <style>
        * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }
        
        :root {
            --primary: #cc0000;
            --secondary: #990000;
            --accent: #ff3333;
            --success: #27ae60;
            --warning: #ffc107;
            --text-dark: #0b0b0b;
            --text-light: #666;
            --bg-light: #f9f9f9;
            --border: #e0e0e0;
        }
        
        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }
        
        body { 
            font-family: 'Segoe UI', -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, sans-serif; 
            color: var(--text-dark); 
            line-height: 1.6;
            background: #fafafa;
        }
        
        /* Header */
        .header {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--primary) 0%, var(--secondary) 100%);
            color: white;
            padding: 2rem 0;
            position: relative;
            overflow: hidden;
        }
        
        .header::before {
            content: '';
            position: absolute;
            top: 0;
            left: 0;
            right: 0;
            bottom: 0;
            background: radial-gradient(circle at 20% 50%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%),
                        radial-gradient(circle at 80% 80%, rgba(255,255,255,0.1) 0%, transparent 50%);
            pointer-events: none;
        }
        
        .header-content {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 0 2rem;
            position: relative;
            z-index: 1;
        }
        
        .header-top {
            font-size: 13px;
            opacity: 0.9;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-weight: 500;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
        }
        
        .header h1 {
            font-size: 40px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            animation: slideDown 0.6s ease;
        }
        
        .header p {
            font-size: 18px;
            opacity: 0.95;
            animation: slideDown 0.8s ease;
        }
        
        @keyframes slideDown {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(-20px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        
        /* Progress Bar */
        .progress-bar {
            height: 4px;
            background: #e0e0e0;
            position: sticky;
            top: 0;
            z-index: 100;
        }
        
        .progress-fill {
            height: 100%;
            background: linear-gradient(90deg, var(--primary), var(--secondary));
            width: 0%;
            transition: width 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        /* Main Container */
        .container {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 3rem 2rem;
        }
        
        /* Table of Contents */
        .toc {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-bottom: 3rem;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary);
        }
        
        .toc h2 {
            font-size: 18px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .toc-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(200px, 1fr));
            gap: 1rem;
        }
        
        .toc-link {
            padding: 0.8rem;
            background: var(--bg-light);
            border-radius: 8px;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            border-left: 3px solid transparent;
        }
        
        .toc-link:hover {
            background: #f0f0f0;
            border-left-color: var(--primary);
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }
        
        /* Sections */
        .section {
            background: white;
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 2.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 2rem;
            box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.08);
            scroll-margin-top: 100px;
            animation: fadeIn 0.6s ease;
        }
        
        @keyframes fadeIn {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
        }
        
        .section-title {
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            gap: 12px;
            color: var(--text-dark);
            border-bottom: 3px solid var(--primary);
            padding-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        .icon {
            width: 45px;
            height: 45px;
            border-radius: 10px;
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            font-size: 24px;
            flex-shrink: 0;
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.1);
        }
        
        .content {
            font-size: 16px;
            line-height: 1.8;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }
        
        .content h3 {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 700;
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .content h3:first-of-type {
            margin-top: 0;
        }
        
        .content p {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
        }
        
        /* Stats Box */
        .stat-box {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.05) 0%, rgba(118, 75, 162, 0.05) 100%);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            border-left: 5px solid var(--primary);
            transition: all 0.3s;
        }
        
        .stat-box:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 20px rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.15);
        }
        
        .stat-number {
            font-size: 32px;
            font-weight: 700;
            color: var(--primary);
            animation: slideInNumber 0.6s ease;
        }
        
        @keyframes slideInNumber {
            from { opacity: 0; transform: translateX(-10px); }
            to { opacity: 1; transform: translateX(0); }
        }
        
        .stat-label {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: var(--text-light);
            margin-top: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        /* Key Points */
        .key-point {
            display: flex;
            gap: 12px;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            padding: 1rem;
            background: var(--bg-light);
            border-radius: 8px;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
        }
        
        .key-point:hover {
            background: #f0f0f0;
            transform: translateX(4px);
        }
        
        .key-point-bullet {
            flex-shrink: 0;
            width: 28px;
            height: 28px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            background: var(--primary);
            display: flex;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            color: white;
            font-weight: 600;
            font-size: 13px;
        }
        
        .key-point-text {
            flex: 1;
        }
        
        /* Highlight Box */
        .highlight {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.1) 0%, rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.05) 100%);
            padding: 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            border-left: 4px solid var(--warning);
            font-style: italic;
            color: #663c00;
        }
        
        /* Quiz */
        .quiz-container {
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.08) 0%, rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.04) 100%);
            border-radius: 12px;
            padding: 1.5rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
            border: 2px solid var(--primary);
        }
        
        .quiz-question {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: var(--text-dark);
        }
        
        .quiz-options {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.8rem;
        }
        
        .quiz-option {
            padding: 1rem;
            border: 2px solid var(--border);
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            background: white;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            font-size: 15px;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        .quiz-option:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background: rgba(102, 126, 234, 0.05);
        }
        
        .quiz-option.correct {
            border-color: var(--success);
            background: rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.1);
            color: var(--success);
        }
        
        .quiz-option.incorrect {
            border-color: var(--accent);
            background: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.1);
            color: var(--accent);
        }
        
        .quiz-feedback {
            margin-top: 1rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            font-weight: 500;
            animation: slideDown 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .quiz-feedback.correct {
            background: rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.1);
            color: var(--success);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--success);
        }
        
        .quiz-feedback.incorrect {
            background: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.1);
            color: var(--accent);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--accent);
        }
        
        /* Myth/Fact */
        .myth-fact-container {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
            gap: 1rem;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        
        .myth-fact-card {
            padding: 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            border: 2px solid transparent;
            font-weight: 500;
        }
        
        .myth-card {
            background: rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.1);
            border-color: var(--accent);
            color: #6b0b0b;
        }
        
        .myth-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(255, 107, 107, 0.2);
        }
        
        .fact-card {
            background: rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.1);
            border-color: var(--success);
            color: #0b6b0b;
        }
        
        .fact-card:hover {
            transform: translateY(-4px);
            box-shadow: 0 8px 16px rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.2);
        }
        
        .myth-fact-label {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 11px;
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 1px;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
            opacity: 0.7;
        }
        
        /* Scenario */
        .scenario-box {
            background: rgba(106, 44, 138, 0.08);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--secondary);
            padding: 1.2rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        
        .scenario-title {
            font-weight: 700;
            font-size: 16px;
            margin-bottom: 0.8rem;
            color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .scenario-text {
            font-size: 15px;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        
        .scenario-choices {
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            gap: 0.8rem;
        }
        
        .scenario-btn {
            padding: 1rem;
            border: 2px solid var(--border);
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        
        .scenario-btn:hover {
            background: var(--bg-light);
            border-color: var(--secondary);
        }
        
        .scenario-result {
            margin-top: 1rem;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            border-left: 4px solid;
            animation: slideDown 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .result-good {
            background: rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.1);
            border-left-color: var(--success);
            color: #0b6b0b;
        }
        
        .result-caution {
            background: rgba(255, 193, 7, 0.1);
            border-left-color: var(--warning);
            color: #663c00;
        }
        
        /* Tabs */
        .tab-buttons {
            display: flex;
            gap: 0.5rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
        }
        
        .tab-btn {
            padding: 0.8rem 1.2rem;
            border: 2px solid var(--border);
            background: white;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            font-size: 15px;
        }
        
        .tab-btn:hover {
            border-color: var(--primary);
            background: var(--bg-light);
        }
        
        .tab-btn.active {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            border-color: var(--primary);
        }
        
        .tab-content {
            display: none;
        }
        
        .tab-content.active {
            display: block;
        }
        
        /* Expandable */
        .expandable-header {
            background: var(--bg-light);
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 8px;
            cursor: pointer;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: space-between;
            align-items: center;
            font-weight: 500;
            transition: all 0.3s;
            margin: 1rem 0;
            border-left: 3px solid var(--primary);
        }
        
        .expandable-header:hover {
            background: #f0f0f0;
        }
        
        .expandable-content {
            max-height: 0;
            overflow: hidden;
            transition: max-height 0.3s ease;
        }
        
        .expandable-content.open {
            max-height: 1000px;
        }
        
        .expandable-text {
            padding: 1rem;
            background: #fafafa;
            border-radius: 0 0 8px 8px;
        }
        
        .toggle-arrow {
            transition: transform 0.3s;
        }
        
        .toggle-arrow.open {
            transform: rotate(180deg);
        }
        
        /* Footer */
        .footer {
            background: var(--text-dark);
            color: white;
            padding: 2rem;
            margin-top: 4rem;
            text-align: center;
            font-size: 14px;
            line-height: 1.8;
        }
        
        .footer-content {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 0 auto;
        }
        
        .footer h3 {
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            font-size: 16px;
        }
        
        .footer p {
            opacity: 0.8;
            margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
        }
        
        .footer-divider {
            height: 1px;
            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.2);
            margin: 1.5rem 0;
        }
        
        .hidden { display: none; }
        
        /* Responsive */
        @media (max-width: 768px) {
            .header h1 {
                font-size: 28px;
            }
            
            .myth-fact-container {
                grid-template-columns: 1fr;
            }
            
            .section {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .container {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
            
            .section-title {
                font-size: 22px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

<div class="progress-bar">
    <div class="progress-fill" id="progressFill"></div>
</div>

<!-- Header -->
<div class="header">
    <div class="header-content">
        <div class="header-top">UNLV DEPARTMENT OF PEDIATRICS</div>
        <h1>Cannabis Education Guide</h1>
        <p>Evidence-based facts for adolescents</p>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Table of Contents -->
<div class="container">
    <div class="toc">
        <h2>📋 Quick Navigation</h2>
        <div class="toc-grid">
            <a href="#brain" class="toc-link">🧠 Brain Development</a>
            <a href="#risks" class="toc-link">⚠️ Health Risks</a>
            <a href="#scenarios" class="toc-link">🎭 Scenarios</a>
            <a href="#stats" class="toc-link">📊 Statistics</a>
            <a href="#legal" class="toc-link">⚖️ Legal Info</a>
            <a href="#prevention" class="toc-link">💪 Prevention</a>
            <a href="#support" class="toc-link">🤝 Support</a>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<!-- Main Content -->
<div class="container">

    <!-- Brain Development -->
    <div class="section" id="brain">
        <div class="section-title">
            <div class="icon">🧠</div>
            Your Brain is Still Under Construction
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Your brain doesn't fully develop until your mid-20s. The parts that handle decision-making, impulse control, and long-term planning are some of the last to finish.</p>
            
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-number">Ages 12–25</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Critical development period for brain maturity</div>
            </div>

            <h3>How THC affects a developing brain:</h3>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">1</div>
                <div class="key-point-text"><strong>Memory & learning:</strong> Regular use can affect how your brain stores and retrieves information</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">2</div>
                <div class="key-point-text"><strong>Motivation:</strong> Heavy use may reduce drive and interest in activities</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">3</div>
                <div class="key-point-text"><strong>Decision-making:</strong> THC can interfere with judgment and impulse control</div>
            </div>

            <div class="highlight">
                These changes can be reversible if use stops, but the younger you start and the more you use, the greater the risk.
            </div>

            <div class="quiz-container">
                <div class="quiz-question">❓ When does your brain finish developing?</div>
                <div class="quiz-options" id="quiz1">
                    <div class="quiz-option" onclick="checkAnswer(this, false)">Around age 15</div>
                    <div class="quiz-option" onclick="checkAnswer(this, true)">Mid-20s</div>
                    <div class="quiz-option" onclick="checkAnswer(this, false)">Age 21</div>
                    <div class="quiz-option" onclick="checkAnswer(this, false)">Around age 18</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Health Risks -->
    <div class="section" id="risks">
        <div class="section-title">
            <div class="icon">⚠️</div>
            Real Health Risks
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h3>Myth vs. Fact</h3>
            <div class="myth-fact-container">
                <div class="myth-fact-card myth-card" onclick="toggleCard(this)">
                    <div class="myth-fact-label">❌ Myth</div>
                    <div class="myth-fact-text">"Weed is totally harmless and natural"</div>
                </div>
                <div class="myth-fact-card fact-card" onclick="toggleCard(this)">
                    <div class="myth-fact-label">✅ Fact</div>
                    <div class="myth-fact-text">"Natural doesn't mean safe, especially for developing brains"</div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <h3>Short-term effects (hours to days):</h3>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">Impaired judgment—driving, decision-making, reaction time</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">Anxiety, panic, or paranoia</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">Cannabis hyperemesis syndrome (CHS)</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">Impaired coordination and balance</div>
            </div>

            <h3>Long-term effects (regular use):</h3>
            <div class="expandable-header" onclick="toggleExpandable(this)">
                <span>📊 Click to reveal long-term risks</span>
                <span class="toggle-arrow">▼</span>
            </div>
            <div class="expandable-content">
                <div class="expandable-text">
                    <div class="key-point">
                        <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                        <div class="key-point-text"><strong>Dependency:</strong> ~1 in 6 teens develop cannabis use disorder</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="key-point">
                        <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                        <div class="key-point-text"><strong>Lung health:</strong> Smoking damages airways</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="key-point">
                        <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                        <div class="key-point-text"><strong>Mental health:</strong> Increased risk of depression, anxiety, psychosis</div>
                    </div>
                    <div class="key-point">
                        <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                        <div class="key-point-text"><strong>Sleep:</strong> Can mess with sleep quality</div>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-number">17%</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Addiction risk if started before 18 (vs. 9% for adults)</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Scenarios -->
    <div class="section" id="scenarios">
        <div class="section-title">
            <div class="icon">🎭</div>
            Real Scenarios: What Would You Do?
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="scenario-box">
                <div class="scenario-title">Scenario 1: Friend Pressure</div>
                <div class="scenario-text">Your friend group is planning to hang out, and some are bringing weed. They say "Come on, it's just weed, everyone's doing it."</div>
                <div class="scenario-choices">
                    <button class="scenario-btn" onclick="showScenarioResult(this, 'good')">Say "No thanks" and stick to it</button>
                    <button class="scenario-btn" onclick="showScenarioResult(this, 'good')">Tell them you're not interested</button>
                    <button class="scenario-btn" onclick="showScenarioResult(this, 'caution')">Go but just watch</button>
                    <button class="scenario-btn" onclick="showScenarioResult(this, 'warning')">Give in to pressure</button>
                </div>
            </div>

            <div class="scenario-box">
                <div class="scenario-title">Scenario 2: Driving Safety</div>
                <div class="scenario-text">At a party, a friend who's been smoking asks for a ride home. They say they're fine to drive.</div>
                <div class="scenario-choices">
                    <button class="scenario-btn" onclick="showScenarioResult(this, 'good')">Call Uber/Lyft or ask a sober friend</button>
                    <button class="scenario-btn" onclick="showScenarioResult(this, 'good')">Tell an adult about it</button>
                    <button class="scenario-btn" onclick="showScenarioResult(this, 'warning')">Accept the ride</button>
                    <button class="scenario-btn" onclick="showScenarioResult(this, 'caution')">Decide to "just be careful"</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Statistics -->
    <div class="section" id="stats">
        <div class="section-title">
            <div class="icon">📊</div>
            The Numbers
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-number">36%</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Of high school seniors have used marijuana</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-number">3–4x</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Stronger than weed from the 90s</div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-number">2x</div>
                <div class="stat-label">Higher addiction risk for teens vs. adults</div>
            </div>

            <h3>What's changed?</h3>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">🔬</div>
                <div class="key-point-text"><strong>Potency explosion:</strong> Modern products have way more THC. Today's vape pens and edibles are much stronger.</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">🍪</div>
                <div class="key-point-text"><strong>Edibles:</strong> Easier to overdose on (delayed onset), hard to control dose, longer-lasting.</div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Legal Info -->
    <div class="section" id="legal">
        <div class="section-title">
            <div class="icon">⚖️</div>
            Legal Reality
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <div class="tab-buttons">
                <button class="tab-btn active" onclick="switchTab(event, 'federal')">Federal Law</button>
                <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(event, 'minor')">If You're a Minor</button>
                <button class="tab-btn" onclick="switchTab(event, 'driving')">Driving & DUI</button>
            </div>

            <div id="federal" class="tab-content active">
                <p>Marijuana is a <strong>Schedule I controlled substance</strong> federally, even though some states have legalized it.</p>
            </div>

            <div id="minor" class="tab-content">
                <div class="key-point">
                    <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                    <div class="key-point-text">Illegal everywhere in the US, regardless of state law</div>
                </div>
                <div class="key-point">
                    <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                    <div class="key-point-text">Penalties vary by state (charges, fines, juvenile record)</div>
                </div>
                <div class="key-point">
                    <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                    <div class="key-point-text">A record can affect college, jobs, housing, scholarships</div>
                </div>
                <div class="highlight">
                    A criminal record is permanent and can derail plans you haven't made yet.
                </div>
            </div>

            <div id="driving" class="tab-content">
                <div class="key-point">
                    <div class="key-point-bullet">🚗</div>
                    <div class="key-point-text">Driving under the influence is illegal everywhere</div>
                </div>
                <div class="key-point">
                    <div class="key-point-bullet">💀</div>
                    <div class="key-point-text">Impaired driving kills. THC slows reaction time.</div>
                </div>
                <div class="key-point">
                    <div class="key-point-bullet">🚨</div>
                    <div class="key-point-text">DUI charges result in license suspension, fines, court costs</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Prevention -->
    <div class="section" id="prevention">
        <div class="section-title">
            <div class="icon">💪</div>
            Why Waiting Is the Smart Move
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h3>The science: Your brain</h3>
            <p>Every year you delay is a year your brain develops more fully. Waiting genuinely reduces your risk.</p>

            <h3>Other reasons:</h3>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">✓</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">Keep your focus on school, sports, activities, friends</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">✓</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">Avoid legal trouble and a permanent record</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">✓</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">Save money</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">✓</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">Stay in control—not letting peer pressure decide</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">✓</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">Know yourself better before experimenting</div>
            </div>

            <h3>If you're already using:</h3>
            <div class="highlight">
                Stopping or cutting back now can still protect your developing brain. It's not too late to make a different choice.
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>

    <!-- Support -->
    <div class="section" id="support">
        <div class="section-title">
            <div class="icon">🤝</div>
            If You Need Help
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <p>Cannabis use disorder is real, it's treatable, and asking for help is strength.</p>

            <div class="stat-box">
                <div class="stat-number">1-800-662-4357</div>
                <div class="stat-label">SAMHSA National Helpline (free, confidential, 24/7)</div>
            </div>

            <h3>Signs it might be time to talk to someone:</h3>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">You're using more than you planned</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">You've tried to cut back but can't</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">It's affecting school, sports, friendships, or family</div>
            </div>
            <div class="key-point">
                <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">You're anxious or paranoid when you use</div>
            </div>
