                <div class="key-point-bullet">•</div>
                <div class="key-point-text">You feel dependent on it to relax or have fun</div>
            </div>

            <h3>Who to talk to:</h3>
            <p>A parent, school counselor, doctor, or therapist can help without judgment.</p>
        </div>
    </div>

</div>

